
# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# Summary line: imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period, max 72 chars.
#   e.g. feat(tracker): add idle detection to screen time tracker
#
# Types:  feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# Scopes: app | ui | pet | tracker | api | docs | ci | deps | release | config
# Breaking change: add "!" after the scope, e.g. feat(api)!: ...
#
# --- Body (wrap at 72 chars) ---
# Why:  the problem or motivation behind this change.
# What: what changed, at a high level (the diff shows the details).
#
# --- Footer ---
# Closes #<issue>
# Refs #<issue>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
